SECURITY
Ah, main samajh gaya! Aapko Client ki original requirement (Business Flow) ke perspective se samajhna hai ki humne Risk Engine mein ab tak kya-kya implement kiya hai—chahe wo Creator Risk ho ya Platform Risk.

Client ka vision tha ek Automated Risk Engine jo fraud ko roke, paise protect kare, aur Admin ko control de. Niche poora Business Flow hai jo humne implement kiya hai:

### 1. Creator Risk Profiling (Individual Creator Level)
Client chahta tha ki har creator ek jaisa nahi hota. Kuch naye hain, kuch purane trusted hain, aur kuch fraud ho sakte hain. Isliye humne 3 Risk Levels banaye:

- Low Risk (Standard):
  
  - Kaun: Trusted creators, kam disputes.
  - Rule: 0% Reserve , 7 Days Payout Delay .
  - Implementation: Agar dispute rate < 0.5% hai, to system automatically ye level deta hai.
- Medium Risk (Warning):
  
  - Kaun: Thode disputes aa rahe hain ya refund rate high hai.
  - Rule: 10% Reserve (Hum 10% paisa hold karte hain future refunds ke liye), 7 Days Delay .
  - Implementation: Agar dispute rate > 0.5% ya refund rate > 5% hai.
- High Risk (Danger):
  
  - Kaun: Bahut disputes, fraud suspicion.
  - Rule: 25% Reserve , 14 Days Payout Delay (Paisa lamba hold karte hain).
  - Implementation: Agar dispute rate > 1% hai.
Feature: Admin dashboard par ab aap har creator ke aage ye "High/Medium/Low" tag dekh sakte hain aur chaho to "Override" karke manually badal sakte ho.

### 2. Platform Risk States (Global Kill Switch)
Client ka kehna tha: "Agar platform par fraud attack ho jaye (e.g. Card Testing), to main ek-ek creator ko block nahi kar sakta. Mujhe ek button chahiye jo sab rok de."

Iske liye humne 4 System States banayi:

- NORMAL (Green): Business as usual.
  
  - Limit: £5,000 spend/day per user.
  - New Creators: 25/day allow.
  - Guest Checkout: Allowed.
- CAUTION (Yellow): Thoda fraud dikh raha hai.
  
  - Limit: £2,500 spend/day.
  - Monitoring: Badh jati hai (Step-Up auth zyada maanga jata hai).
- THROTTLE (Orange): Attack confirm ho gaya hai.
  
  - Limit: £1,500 spend/day.
  - Action: Guest Payments BLOCKED (Kyunki fraud zyada guests karte hain).
  - New Creators: 0 (Naye signups band).
- FREEZE (Red - The Nuclear Option): Emergency.
  
  - Limit: £0 (Ek rupaya bhi move nahi hoga).
  - Action: Sab payments blocked. Platform pause mode mein.
Feature: Admin dashboard ke top-right mein ab wo button hai jisse aap ye state badal sakte hain.

### 3. Transaction Rules (The Invisible Guard)
Backend mein humne Rules lagaye hain jo har payment par check hote hain (Client ki "Safety Net"):

- Velocity Check: Agar koi user 10 minute mein 3 payments kar chuka hai -> Step-Up (OTP) maango. Agar 5 kar chuka hai -> Cooldown (Block for 15 min) .
- New Creator Limit: Ek user ek din mein sirf 1 Naye Creator ko pay kar sakta hai (Fraudsters ek hi card se 50 naye accounts ko pay karte hain).
- Hourly/Daily Limits: Koi bhi user £5000 se zyada ek din mein kharch nahi kar sakta (Normal state mein).
### 4. Dispute Evidence System
Client ne kaha tha: "Jab dispute aata hai, mujhe dikhna chahiye ki creator ne kya safai di hai."

- Flow: Jab bank chargeback karta hai -> Creator form bharta hai aur files upload karta hai -> Admin ab Dashboard par "Disputes" click karke wo files aur explanation padh sakta hai taaki decide kare ki fight karna hai ya nahi.
### Summary: Ab System Kya Kar Raha Hai?
1. Monitor: Har payment aur creator ko watch kar raha hai.
2. Classify: Creators ko automatically Low/Medium/High mein daal raha hai.
3. Protect: Agar attack hua, to Admin ek click mein "System Freeze" kar sakta hai.
4. Report: Admin ko disputes aur risk history dikha raha hai.
Ye wo poora ecosystem hai jo humne banaya hai.


